<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="th">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>บ้านธรรมสถิตย์ - Baan Thumsathis</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg-dark-green: #1A3026;
            --bg-card: #223D31;
            --accent-gold: #C5A059;
            --gold-hover: #E5C17C;
            --text-light: #F4F1EA;
            --text-muted: #A3B1A8;
        }

        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
        }

        body {
            background-color: var(--bg-dark-green);
            color: var(--text-light);
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        /* Navigation Bar */
        nav {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 0.8rem 5%;
            background-color: rgba(26, 48, 38, 0.95);
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--accent-gold);
            position: sticky;
            top: 0;
            z-index: 100;
        }

        .logo-container {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 1rem;
        }

        .logo-img {
            height: 45px;
            width: auto;
            object-fit: contain;
            filter: drop-shadow(0px 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.5));
        }

        .logo-text {
            font-size: 1.15rem;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: var(--accent-gold);
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
            white-space: nowrap;
        }

        .nav-links {
            display: flex;
            list-style: none;
            gap: 1.5rem;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .nav-links a {
            color: var(--text-light);
            text-decoration: none;
            transition: color 0.3s;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            white-space: nowrap;
        }

        .nav-links a:hover {
            color: var(--accent-gold);
        }

        .nav-right {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 1rem;
        }

        .lang-btn {
            background: transparent;
            border: 1px solid var(--accent-gold);
            color: var(--accent-gold);
            padding: 0.3rem 0.8rem;
            cursor: pointer;
            border-radius: 4px;
            font-weight: bold;
            transition: all 0.3s;
        }

        .lang-btn:hover {
            background-color: var(--accent-gold);
            color: var(--bg-dark-green);
        }

        /* Hamburger Menu for Mobile */
        .menu-toggle {
            display: none;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: space-between;
            width: 28px;
            height: 21px;
            background: transparent;
            border: none;
            cursor: pointer;
            z-index: 101;
        }

        .menu-toggle span {
            width: 100%;
            height: 3px;
            background-color: var(--accent-gold);
            border-radius: 3px;
            transition: all 0.3s;
        }

        @media (max-width: 992px) {
            .menu-toggle {
                display: flex;
            }
            .nav-links {
                position: fixed;
                top: 0;
                right: -100%;
                width: 75%;
                height: 100vh;
                background-color: #12221B;
                flex-direction: column;
                justify-content: center;
                align-items: center;
                gap: 2rem;
                transition: right 0.3s ease-in-out;
                border-left: 1px solid var(--accent-gold);
                box-shadow: -5px 0 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.6);
            }
            .nav-links.active {
                right: 0;
            }
            .nav-links a {
                font-size: 1.1rem;
            }
        }

        /* Hero Section */
        .hero {
            padding: 3rem 5% 4rem;
            text-align: center;
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(197, 160, 89, 0.3);
        }

        .hero-logo {
            max-width: 220px;
            height: auto;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
            filter: drop-shadow(0px 6px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.6));
        }

        .hero h1 {
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            color: var(--accent-gold);
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        }

        .hero h2 {
            font-size: 1.25rem;
            color: var(--text-light);
            font-weight: normal;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }

        .hero p {
            font-size: 1.05rem;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            max-width: 700px;
            margin: 0 auto 2rem;
        }

        .hero-banner-img {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 900px;
            height: 380px;
            object-fit: cover;
            border-radius: 12px;
            border: 1px solid var(--accent-gold);
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
            box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.4);
        }

        .hero-buttons {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 1rem;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        .btn-gold {
            display: inline-block;
            background-color: var(--accent-gold);
            color: var(--bg-dark-green);
            padding: 0.8rem 1.8rem;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: bold;
            border-radius: 4px;
            transition: background 0.3s;
        }

        .btn-gold:hover {
            background-color: var(--gold-hover);
        }

        .btn-outline {
            display: inline-block;
            border: 1px solid var(--accent-gold);
            color: var(--accent-gold);
            padding: 0.8rem 1.8rem;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: bold;
            border-radius: 4px;
            transition: all 0.3s;
        }

        .btn-outline:hover {
            background-color: rgba(197, 160, 89, 0.15);
            color: var(--gold-hover);
        }

        /* Founder Showcase Section */
        .founder-section {
            padding: 4rem 5%;
            background-color: rgba(26, 48, 38, 0.6);
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(197, 160, 89, 0.3);
        }

        .founder-container {
            max-width: 1100px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            background-color: var(--bg-card);
            border: 1px solid var(--accent-gold);
            border-radius: 12px;
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.5fr;
            gap: 2.5rem;
            padding: 2.5rem;
            align-items: start;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
        }

        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .founder-container {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
                padding: 1.5rem;
            }
        }

        .founder-img-box {
            text-align: center;
            position: sticky;
            top: 100px;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 1rem;
        }

        .founder-img {
            width: 100%;
            height: auto;
            object-fit: contain;
            background-color: #1A3026;
            border-radius: 8px;
            border: 1px solid var(--accent-gold);
            box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.4);
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: transform 0.3s;
        }

        .founder-img:hover {
            transform: scale(1.02);
        }

        .founder-content h3 {
            color: var(--accent-gold);
            font-size: 1.8rem;
            margin-bottom: 0.3rem;
        }

        .founder-national-artist {
            color: var(--gold-hover);
            font-size: 1.05rem;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
        }

        .founder-content p {
            color: var(--text-light);
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            line-height: 1.8;
            font-size: 1.02rem;
        }

        .founder-content .founder-subtitle {
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
            font-style: italic;
        }

        .biography-detail {
            margin-top: 1.5rem;
            border-top: 1px solid rgba(197, 160, 89, 0.3);
            padding-top: 1.5rem;
        }

        .biography-detail h4 {
            color: var(--accent-gold);
            margin: 1.2rem 0 0.5rem 0;
            font-size: 1.2rem;
        }

        .biography-detail ul {
            margin-left: 1.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            color: var(--text-light);
        }

        .biography-detail li {
            margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        /* Highlights Section */
        .section-title {
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 1.8rem;
            color: var(--accent-gold);
            margin: 4rem 0 2rem;
        }

        .grid-container {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
            gap: 2rem;
            padding: 0 5% 2rem;
        }

        .card {
            background-color: var(--bg-card);
            border: 1px solid rgba(197, 160, 89, 0.3);
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 1.5rem;
            text-align: center;
            transition: transform 0.3s, border-color 0.3s;
            overflow: hidden;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        .card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-5px);
            border-color: var(--accent-gold);
        }

        .card-img {
            width: 100%;
            height: 200px;
            object-fit: cover;
            border-radius: 6px;
            margin-bottom: 1.2rem;
            border: 1px solid rgba(197, 160, 89, 0.2);
        }

        .card h3 {
            color: var(--accent-gold);
            margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
        }

        .card p {
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-size: 0.95rem;
        }

        .card-hint {
            display: inline-block;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            color: var(--accent-gold);
            margin-top: 0.8rem;
            text-decoration: underline;
        }

        /* Article Specific Styles */
        .article-card {
            text-align: left;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: space-between;
        }

        .article-date {
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            color: var(--accent-gold);
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        }

        .article-excerpt {
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            display: -webkit-box;
            -webkit-line-clamp: 3;
            -webkit-box-orient: vertical;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        /* Video Showcase Section Styles */
        .video-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px, 1fr));
            gap: 2rem;
            padding: 0 5% 4rem;
        }

        .video-card {
            background-color: var(--bg-card);
            border: 1px solid rgba(197, 160, 89, 0.3);
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 1.2rem;
            text-align: center;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
        }

        .video-wrapper {
            position: relative;
            width: 100%;
            border-radius: 6px;
            overflow: hidden;
            border: 1px solid rgba(197, 160, 89, 0.2);
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            background-color: #000;
        }

        .video-wrapper video {
            width: 100%;
            height: auto;
            display: block;
        }

        .video-card h3 {
            color: var(--accent-gold);
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
            font-size: 1.15rem;
        }

        .video-card p {
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }

        /* Modals / Pop-ups */
        .modal {
            display: none;
            position: fixed;
            z-index: 1000;
            left: 0;
            top: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            flex-direction: column;
        }

        .modal-content {
            max-width: 85%;
            max-height: 70vh;
            border-radius: 8px;
            border: 2px solid var(--accent-gold);
            object-fit: contain;
        }

        .modal-caption {
            margin-top: 1rem;
            color: var(--accent-gold);
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        .modal-close {
            position: absolute;
            top: 20px;
            right: 30px;
            color: var(--text-light);
            font-size: 40px;
            font-weight: bold;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        .modal-close:hover {
            color: var(--accent-gold);
        }

        .modal-nav {
            position: absolute;
            top: 50%;
            transform: translateY(-50%);
            background: rgba(197, 160, 89, 0.3);
            color: white;
            padding: 0.8rem 1.2rem;
            border: none;
            cursor: pointer;
            font-size: 2rem;
            border-radius: 4px;
            transition: 0.3s;
        }

        .modal-nav:hover {
            background: var(--accent-gold);
            color: var(--bg-dark-green);
        }

        .prev-btn { left: 20px; }
        .next-btn { right: 20px; }

        /* Article Modal Custom Styling */
        .article-modal-box {
            background-color: var(--bg-card);
            border: 2px solid var(--accent-gold);
            border-radius: 10px;
            padding: 2.5rem;
            max-width: 750px;
            width: 90%;
            max-height: 80vh;
            overflow-y: auto;
            color: var(--text-light);
            position: relative;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.8);
        }

        .article-modal-box h2 {
            color: var(--accent-gold);
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        }

        .article-modal-box .meta {
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(197, 160, 89, 0.3);
            padding-bottom: 0.5rem;
        }

        .article-modal-box img {
            width: 100%;
            height: auto;
            border-radius: 6px;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
            border: 1px solid var(--accent-gold);
        }

        .article-modal-box p {
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            line-height: 1.8;
            color: var(--text-light);
        }

        /* Visitor Info Box */
        .info-box {
            margin: 2rem 5% 4rem;
            padding: 2.5rem;
            background-color: var(--bg-card);
            border: 1px solid var(--accent-gold);
            border-radius: 8px;
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
            gap: 2rem;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .info-item h4 {
            color: var(--accent-gold);
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
        }

        .info-item a {
            color: var(--gold-hover);
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        .info-item a:hover {
            text-decoration: underline;
        }

        /* Footer */
        footer {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 2rem;
            background-color: #12221B;
            border-top: 1px solid var(--accent-gold);
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <!-- Navigation Bar -->
    <nav>
        <div class="logo-container">
            <img src="logo.png" alt="บ้านธรรมสถิตย์" class="logo-img">
            <div class="logo-text" id="site-logo">บ้านธรรมสถิตย์</div>
        </div>
        <ul class="nav-links" id="navLinks">
            <li><a href="#home" class="lang-text" onclick="closeMenu()" data-th="หน้าแรก" data-en="Home" data-zh="首页">หน้าแรก</a></li>
            <li><a href="#founder" class="lang-text" onclick="closeMenu()" data-th="ร้อยตรี ดร.ทวี บูรณเขตต์" data-en="Sgt. Maj. Dr. Thawee" data-zh="贾特威博士">ร้อยตรี ดร.ทวี บูรณเขตต์</a></li>
            <li><a href="#exhibition" class="lang-text" onclick="closeMenu()" data-th="นิทรรศการ" data-en="Exhibition" data-zh="展览">นิทรรศการ</a></li>
            <li><a href="#articles" class="lang-text" onclick="closeMenu()" data-th="บทความ" data-en="Articles" data-zh="文章">บทความ</a></li>
            <li><a href="#videos" class="lang-text" onclick="closeMenu()" data-th="วิดีโอ" data-en="Videos" data-zh="视频">วิดีโอ</a></li>
            <li><a href="#workshop" class="lang-text" onclick="closeMenu()" data-th="เวิร์กชอป" data-en="Workshops" data-zh="工作坊">เวิร์กชอป</a></li>
            <li><a href="#visit" class="lang-text" onclick="closeMenu()" data-th="เข้าชม & ติดต่อ" data-en="Visit & Contact" data-zh="参观与联系">เข้าชม & ติดต่อ</a></li>
        </ul>
        <div class="nav-right">
            <button class="lang-btn" onclick="toggleLanguage()">EN</button>
            <button class="menu-toggle" id="menuToggle" onclick="toggleMenu()" aria-label="Toggle Menu">
                <span></span>
                <span></span>
                <span></span>
            </button>
        </div>
    </nav>

    <!-- Hero Section -->
    <section class="hero" id="home">
        <img src="logo.png" alt="ตราบ้านธรรมสถิตย์" class="hero-logo">
        <h1 class="lang-text" data-th="บ้านธรรมสถิตย์" data-en="Baan Thumsathis" data-zh="彭世洛 ธรรมสถิตย์ 艺术馆">บ้านธรรมสถิตย์</h1>
        <h2 class="lang-text" data-th="ผู้สืบสานสกุลช่างพิษณุโลก จ่าทวี" data-en="Inheritors of Phitsanulok Craftsman Lineage by Sgt. Maj. Thawee" data-zh="彭世洛 传统工艺流派“贾特威” (Sgt. Maj. Thawee) 传人">ผู้สืบสานสกุลช่างพิษณุโลก จ่าทวี</h2>
        <p class="lang-text" 
           data-th="แหล่งเรียนรู้ความโดดเด่นแห่งงานพุทธศิลป์ สกุลช่างพิษณุโลก จ่าทวี พร้อมกิจกรรมเวิร์กชอป" 
           data-en="A learning center dedicated to Phitsanulok's Buddhist art heritage, fine craftsmanship, and interactive workshops."
           data-zh="彭世洛传统佛教艺术与传统工艺学习中心，提供丰富的手工体验工作坊">
           แหล่งเรียนรู้ความโดดเด่นแห่งงานพุทธศิลป์ สกุลช่างพิษณุโลก จ่าทวี พร้อมกิจกรรมเวิร์กชอป
        </p>

        <img src="new-banner.jpg" alt="บรรยากาศบ้านธรรมสถิตย์" class="hero-banner-img" onerror="this.onerror=null; this.src='https://via.placeholder.com/900x380/223D31/C5A059?text=Baan+Thumsathis';">

        <div class="hero-buttons">
            <a href="#visit" class="btn-gold lang-text" data-th="ติดต่อเข้าชม" data-en="Plan Your Visit" data-zh="预约参观">ติดต่อเข้าชม</a>
            <a href="https://maps.app.goo.gl/iLSVSCJrQBqy1eLS8?g_st=ic" target="_blank" class="btn-outline lang-text" data-th="📍 แผนที่เดินทาง" data-en="📍 Google Maps" data-zh="📍 谷歌地图">📍 แผนที่เดินทาง</a>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Founder Showcase Section -->
    <section class="founder-section" id="founder">
        <div class="founder-container">
            <div class="founder-img-box">
                <img src="roytree.jpg" alt="ร้อยตรี ดร.ทวี บูรณเขตต์ ภาพที่ ๑" class="founder-img" onerror="this.onerror=null; this.src='https://via.placeholder.com/400x300/1A3026/C5A059?text=Dr.Thawee+1';">
                <img src="roytree-2.jpg" alt="ร้อยตรี ดร.ทวี บูรณเขตต์ ภาพที่ ๒" class="founder-img" onerror="this.onerror=null; this.src='https://via.placeholder.com/400x300/1A3026/C5A059?text=Dr.Thawee+2';">
            </div>
            <div class="founder-content">
                <h3 class="lang-text" data-th="ร้อยตรี ดร.ทวี บูรณเขตต์" data-en="Sub Lieutenant Dr. Thawee Booranaket" data-zh="贾特威·布拉纳克特 博士 (Sub Lt. Dr. Thawee Booranaket)">ร้อยตรี ดร.ทวี บูรณเขตต์</h3>
                <div class="founder-national-artist lang-text" 
                     data-th="ศิลปินแห่งชาติ ประจำปี พ.ศ. ๒๕๖๖ สาขาทัศนศิลป์ (ประณีตศิลป์–ช่างปั้นและช่างหล่อ)" 
                     data-en="National Artist 2023 in Visual Arts (Fine Arts - Sculptor and Founder)"
                     data-zh="2023年国家艺术家（视觉艺术·雕塑与铸造工艺领域）">
                    ศิลปินแห่งชาติ ประจำปี พ.ศ. ๒๕๖๖ สาขาทัศนศิลป์ (ประณีตศิลป์–ช่างปั้นและช่างหล่อ)
                </div>
                <div class="founder-subtitle lang-text" 
                     data-th="ปูชนียบุคคลแห่งศิลปหัตถกรรมไทย และผู้ก่อตั้งสกุลช่างพิษณุโลก" 
                     data-en="A revered pioneer of Thai arts & crafts and founder of the Phitsanulok Craftsman School"
                     data-zh="泰国工艺美术界的尊崇前辈与彭世洛传统工艺流派奠基人">
                    ปูชนียบุคคลแห่งศิลปหัตถกรรมไทย และผู้ก่อตั้งสกุลช่างพิษณุโลก
                </div>
                <p class="lang-text" 
